      "message": "How do you think about the semantics of the RemoteResponse in the Connection class vs this message received bit? It seems like they would be the same thing or is one supposed to semantically be for incoming requests vs. the other only handling responses.\n\nMaybe this should be something like RequestReceiver or RequestHandler?",
